Package: flexsae
Type: Package
Title: Flexible Non-Linear Small Area Estimation for Area-Level Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Ridson", "Al Farizal P", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "alfrzlp@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0617-0214"))
Description: Small area estimation for area-level data when the relationship
    between the target and the covariates is non-linear. Planned models are a
    semiparametric Fay-Herriot model with penalized splines and a Fay-Herriot
    model combined with random forests, with bootstrap mean squared error
    estimation, selection of covariates, benchmarking to aggregate targets and
    'ggplot2' visualizations. The package is under development and does not
    yet export model functions.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/ridsonap/flexsae
BugReports: https://github.com/ridsonap/flexsae/issues
